  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-scan-code",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：代码安全扫描工具\n\nCodeGuard MCP是一款实时AI代码安全扫描工具，用于检测AI生成代码中的漏洞、密钥和合规性问题，适用于开发环境中的代码安全审查。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **scanCode** — Scan code for security vulnerabilities, secrets, and compliance issues\n- **scanVulnerabilities** — Quick scan for code vulnerabilities only\n- **detectSecrets** — Detect exposed secrets, API keys, and credentials\n- **suggestSecureFix** — Generate secure code fixes for vulnerabilities\n- **checkCompliance** — Check code for regulatory compliance (GDPR, HIPAA, SOC2, PCI DSS)"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-scan-code\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-scan-code\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
